# Callout test bed

Ordinary paragraph before the callouts.

> [!NOTE]
> Baseline for this runbook: commit `55a6abb`. The repo still has **no release tags**.

> [!TIP]
> Lowercase and mixed-case markers are accepted on load and normalized to uppercase on save.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Key information the reader must not miss.

> [!WARNING]
> This release assumes prod is already at `0.1.43`'s schema.

> [!CAUTION]
> **Migration 0014** must be applied before the Worker is deployed.
>
> A second paragraph inside the same callout.

> [!TIP]
> A callout with a list:
>
> -   first item
> -   second item

> Plain blockquote — no marker, no callout styling.

> [!HINT]
> Not one of the five types, so this stays an ordinary blockquote with literal marker text.

> [!NOTE] Marker on the same line as text is a plain blockquote too, matching GitHub.
